s(0, 0, 0, 0);\n    return d.getTime();\n  }\n\n  throw new Error(`Unsupported cron expression: ${expr}`);\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2,"newLines":7,"lines":["  * A deliberately tiny cron implementation supporting only the three patterns","  * required by the queue:","  *","- *   - `*​/N * * * *` — every N minutes (on minutes divisible by N)","+ *   - `every N minutes` via the form star-slash-N (on minutes divisible by N)","  *   - `0 * * * *`    — every hour on the hour","  *   - `0 0 * * *`    — every day at midnight","  *"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
